# an integer option with only a long name, missing its argument
program OneName
arg --number
status 1
output
Error: Argument required for option --number
onename [options]

  -t <arg>
      String option with short name only.
  --text <arg>
      String option with long name only.
  -n <arg>
      Integer option with short name only.
  --number <arg>
      Integer option with long name only.
Terminated by Halt(1). 
